  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Primary path",
      "items": [
        "./setup.sh: link dotfiles → GitHub login → packages → mise bootstrap → mise install → setup/misc.sh → extensions → dotfiles-extras.sh",
        "mise bootstrap applies files, dotfiles and the login shell; setup.sh then runs mise install and the task (misc.sh) alone",
        "gh is installed alone and gh auth login offered before the packages, which spend GitHub's anonymous 60 API calls an hour; a run that cannot ask only warns",
        "A failed package or tool only warns: the list prints last and setup exits 2",
        "-- --skip packages skips the package steps; --dash adds dash.sh",
        "Idempotent: re-running is how changes are applied",
        "From a terminal, each run is recorded to private/setup-logs/ for /validate-setup"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Trust boundaries",
      "items": [
        "sudo -v once; setup.sh runs sudo -k before mise install (the pre-tools hook does it for a bare mise bootstrap)",
        "Root writes: packages (cask installers), /etc/pam.d/sudo_local, the login shell",
        "misc.sh never uses sudo; dotfiles-extras.sh asks only to link cot or code",
        "A package's [credential] sections move from the tracked gitconfig to ~/.gitconfig.local",
        "macOS preferences are never applied: setup always passes --skip macos-defaults",
        "Third-party code: mise.run, package sources, claude.ai/install.sh; Homebrew is never run",
        "misc.sh trusts the Aspire HTTPS dev cert in your login keychain (macOS may ask)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Supply-chain guards",
      "items": [
        "npm min-release-age 7 and allow-git none",
        "Iosevka font: ETag check, SHA-256 notice",
        "Telemetry opt-outs in setup.sh and zsh/env.zsh"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Maintenance loop: sysup",
      "items": [
        "softwareupdate (password via 1Password op read, optional)",
        "mise bootstrap packages upgrade, mise upgrade, uv tool upgrade",
        "claude-config save, then claude-catalog rebuild"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "slate",
      "title": "Never tracked",
      "items": [
        "~/.zsh.local, ~/.gitconfig.local, ~/.ssh/config.local",
        "~/.claude/CLAUDE.md (codegraph rewrites it)",
        "Per-machine .codegraph/ index"
      ]
    }
  ]
